Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - database and observation executor
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 This package contains rts2-db: the PostgreSQL-backed target/observation
 database schema and bootstrap tooling (rts2-builddb, rts2-configdb), the
 target-management command-line tools (rts2-newtarget, rts2-target,
 rts2-targetinfo, rts2-targetlist), and rts2-executor, the daemon that
 selects and carries out observations of database-defined targets. On
 first install, postinst provisions a local 'stars' database (system user
 and Postgres role 'rts2', schema, standard lookup data) if one does not
 already exist - it never touches an existing database. Requires
 rts2-base for the underlying device drivers and wire protocol.
